PART 5: SPECTRAL ZETA FUNCTION AND FUNCTIONAL EQUATION
========================================================

For the Riemann zeta function:
  zeta(s) = zeta(1-s) * Gamma factor   (functional equation)

For the tournament spectral zeta:
  zeta_T(s) = sum_{lambda != 0, 1} |lambda|^{-s}

